# Every hand-written source file in this repository is stored LF, and is checked
# out LF on every platform, whatever `core.autocrlf` says locally. Two files
# (Pages/Map.OldCrew.cs, Pages/Map.ShuttleWindow.cs) once escaped this because a
# literal NUL inside a string literal made git call them binary; a Windows lane
# that rewrote one of them with LF then reddened a source-reading test whose
# regex was written against the other kind of break. Pin it here instead.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cs      text eol=lf
*.razor   text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf
*.js      text eol=lf
*.mjs     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.txt     text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
*.csproj  text eol=lf
*.slnx    text eol=lf
*.props   text eol=lf
*.html    text eol=lf
*.svg     text eol=lf
*.tex     text eol=lf
*.py      text eol=lf
*.ps1     text eol=lf
*.sh      text eol=lf

# What the game ships that is not text. Only .jpg, .png and .pdf are in the tree
# today; the rest are the shapes art and audio arrive in, listed so the first one
# committed does not arrive line-ending-mangled.
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.png   binary
*.webp  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.mp3   binary
*.ogg   binary
*.wav   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf   binary
*.otf   binary
*.pdf   binary
